From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rhnvrm <hello@rohanverma.net>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:16:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] perf: batch read receipt privacy preference reads

Load the requested member preferences with one array-bound query instead of one read per member. Preserve missing-row defaults, privacy timestamp parsing and fail-closed database errors. Add store, app and benchmark coverage without schema changes or caches.

Builds on Karan Sharma (mr-karan) and the read-receipts feature in opnlabs/mattermax#20. Existing feature patch authorship remains unchanged.

Mattermax-Patch: read-receipt-preference-reads.patch
